Lesson (stxt.play.tutorial): Next steps
    Number of lesson: 6 (extra)
    Introduction >>
        From this point, you can try the rest
        of the examples, and see how templates
        work. Play with them, adding and
        removing elements, and how afect the
        existing documents:

        - If appropiate, use MARKDOWN insted of TEXT
        - Try other types, such INTEGER or ENUM
        - Make documents with multiple namespaces
        - Put diferents cardinalities of childs

        Once you are confident, you can
        browse https://stxt.dev to see
        the specification of the language,
        tools, parsers, and more.
